// Hebrew (he) — Afro-Asiatic (Semitic), Hebrew abjad, MODERN ISRAELI. PHASE-1 niqqud→IPA g2p over VOCALIZED input
// (unvocalized restoration is Phase 2, deferred). Referee: en.wiktionary vocalized-form → a=IL Modern-Israeli IPA.
// The backbone folds neutralise marks the (pointed) orthography does not determine: STRESS (ˈ, phonemic but
// unwritten), SYLLABLE dots, the OPTIONAL-realisation parens ((ʔ)(h)(ʕ) — keep the content, drop the parens), and
// the variable GLOTTAL (⟨א⟩/⟨ע⟩ = ʔ, Modern Hebrew drops it inconsistently → fold). Vowel quality + the consonant
// skeleton (dagesh/bgdkpt, shin/sin) are compared directly.
